55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Meeting Ref</span><br><code style=\"font-size:.75rem\">MIN-2017-09-5656</code></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><span style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;padding:.2rem .5rem;background:#dcfce7;color:#15803d;border:1px solid #86efac\">&#10003; QUORUM ESTABLISHED</span><span style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">6 of 8 members present</span></div></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Attendance</h5><table class=\"dash-table w-100\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Title</th><th>Role</th><th style=\"text-align:center\">Present</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=\"opacity:.5\"><td style=\"font-weight:400\">Ximena Mbeki</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Director of Business Operations</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Project Manager</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ccc\">&mdash;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Winston Lee</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Director of Cloud Strategy</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Environmental Consultant (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Qian Chaudhuri</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Vice President of Marketing</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Valuation Specialist (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Cristina Fujiwara</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Senior Analyst, Market Intelligence</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Chief Privacy Officer</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Anastasia Dillon</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Director of Information Security</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Cloud Architecture Advisor (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr style=\"opacity:.5\"><td style=\"font-weight:400\">Kristen Kamath</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Vice President of Strategy</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Ex Officio Member</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ccc\">&mdash;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Jakkrit Norris</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Marketing Analyst</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Designated Owner</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Zbigniew Shalom</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Relationship Manager</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Proxy Solicitor (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Agenda</h5><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 1</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Retirement Plan Investment Performance — Q4 Review</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The committee considered the Retirement Plan Investment Performance — Q4 Review, a proposal to adopt a new policy on corporate political activity. The policy was approved and will be implemented company-wide.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 2</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Regional Business Review: Americas</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The committee discussed the Regional Business Review: Americas, a review of the company&#x27;s compliance with the Securities Exchange Act of 1934. The committee reviewed the company&#x27;s periodic reports and confirmed that they were in compliance.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To approve for leveraging:</strong> RESOLVED, that the Credit Risk Management Committee authorizes a share repurchase program of up to $31M of the company&#x27;s common stock.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Cristina Fujiwara &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Qian Chaudhuri</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 5 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 1 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 3</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Public Policy Priorities for FY2017</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The Public Policy Priorities for FY2017 was a review of the company&#x27;s customer satisfaction scores. The scores had declined by 18% in the 6 region. The committee requested a detailed action plan from the regional leadership team.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 4</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Workforce Reduction Planning — Notification Requirements</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The Workforce Reduction Planning — Notification Requirements was a review of the company&#x27;s customer satisfaction scores. The scores had declined by 18% in the 6 region. The committee requested a detailed action plan from the regional leadership team.</p></div></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Action Items</h5><table class=\"dash-table w-100\"><thead><tr><th style=\"width:2rem\">#</th><th>Description</th><th>Owner</th><th>Due</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">1</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Review the company&#x27;s data privacy policy for compliance with CPRA and GDPR</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Angus Tadesse</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2017-11-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">2</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Provide a demonstration of the new workforce analytics dashboard</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Khalid Ocampo</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2017-11-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">3</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Review the company&#x27;s dividend policy in light of recent financial performance</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Kelsey Dillon</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2017-10-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">4</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Draft talking points for the CEO regarding the Retirement Plan Investment Performance — Q4 Review for the earnings call</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Ute Hartley</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2017-11-28</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style=\"border:1px solid var(--border);padding:1rem 1.2rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem\"><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:#333;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:.5rem\">There being no further business, a motion to adjourn was made and carried unanimously. Meeting adjourned at 4:00 PM CT.</p><p style=\"font-size:.83rem;margin-bottom:.75rem;color:#555\"><strong>Next meeting:</strong> 2017-10-06</p><div><p style=\"font-size:.78rem;color:#888;margin-bottom:.25rem\">Respectfully submitted,</p><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.1rem\">Zbigniew Shalom</p><p style=\"font-size:.78rem;color:#666;margin-bottom:.75rem\">Relationship Manager, Proxy Solicitor (External)</p><div style=\"display:flex;gap:2rem\"><div><div style=\"width:160px;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa;margin-bottom:.2rem;height:1.5rem\"></div><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;color:#888\">Signature</div></div><div><div style=\"width:120px;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa;margin-bottom:.2rem;height:1.5rem\"></div><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;color:#888\">Approved: ___________</div></div></div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:1rem;bo